<view class="page support-page">
  <view class="support-hero card">
    <view class="eyebrow">急性期支持</view>
    <view class="support-title">先撑过这 10 分钟</view>
    <view class="support-subtitle">现在不需要做决定。先把冲动放到这里，让身体和脑子都慢一点。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="boundary">{{boundary}}</view>

  <view class="safety-card card">
    <view class="safety-title">如果你担心自己或他人的安全</view>
    <view class="safety-content">请先联系身边可信赖的人，或立即联系当地紧急救助渠道。这里提供情绪支持，不能替代紧急救助。</view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{safetyNotice}}" class="risk-card card">
    <view class="risk-title">先处理安全，不要独自硬撑</view>
    <view class="risk-content">{{safetyNotice}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="section">
    <view class="section-header">
      <text class="section-title">现在最强的是哪一种？</text>
    </view>
    <view class="reason-grid">
      <view
        wx:for="{{reasons}}"
        wx:key="value"
        class="reason-card card {{selectedReason === item.value ? 'active' : ''}}"
        data-value="{{item.value}}"
        bindtap="chooseReason"
      >
        {{item.label}}
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="section">
    <view class="section-header">
      <text class="section-title">先写下来，不发送</text>
      <text class="section-action">{{draft.length}} / 500</text>
    </view>
    <textarea
      class="urge-input card"
      value="{{draft}}"
      maxlength="500"
      placeholder="{{selectedPrompt}}"
      bindinput="onDraftInput"
    />
    <button class="primary-button save-button" loading="{{submitting}}" bindtap="saveUrge">先存下，10 分钟后再决定</button>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{savedRecord}}" class="saved-card card">
    <view class="saved-title">已经先存下</view>
    <view class="saved-content">这次是「{{savedRecord.reasonText}}」。接下来 10 分钟先不要发消息，按下面的缓冲步骤走一遍。</view>
    <view wx:if="{{savedRecord.hasSafetyRisk}}" class="saved-risk">这条记录已标记为需要优先处理安全，请先联系现实中的可信赖支持或紧急救助渠道。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="section">
    <view class="section-header">
      <text class="section-title">10 分钟缓冲步骤</text>
      <text class="section-action">已记录 {{recordCount}} 次</text>
    </view>
    <view class="step-list">
      <view wx:for="{{bufferSteps}}" wx:key="*this" class="step-row card">
        <view class="step-index">{{index + 1}}</view>
        <view class="step-content">{{item}}</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="support-actions">
    <button class="primary-button support-action-main" bindtap="openAgent">找 Agent 陪我说完整</button>
    <button class="secondary-button support-action-secondary" bindtap="openReview">判断要不要联系 TA</button>
    <button class="secondary-button support-action-secondary" bindtap="openPublish">发到阵线小队</button>
  </view>
</view>
